<Behavior #tui-questionnaire-continuation apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #continue-after-questionnaire (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZB>
      TUI questionnaire replies SHALL continue the unblocked runtime turn rather than treating mailbox submission as final completion.
      </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZB>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #reply-continuation { name = "Reply continuation" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #facade-submit-resumes-turn (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZC>
              A runtime bridge supports submitQuestionnaireResponse and resumeTurn
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZC>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZD>
              The user replies to a pending questionnaire
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZD>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZE>
              The TUI SHALL submit the answer and then call resumeTurn on the same runtime session
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZE>
            )>
            <Case #continuation-output-visible (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZF>
              The resumed runtime emits assistant output after questionnaire approval
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZF>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZG>
              The answer is submitted through the TUI question bridge
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZG>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZH>
              The TUI SHALL synchronize and expose the assistant output before returning the session to idle
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZH>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #human-wait-boundary (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZJ>
      Foreground runtime execution SHALL return control promptly when a questionnaire reaches a human wait boundary, without classifying the wait as an unsettled timeout.
      </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZJ>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #foreground-human-wait { name = "Foreground human wait" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #pause-all-questionnaire-stops-foreground (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZK>
              A foreground fiber is suspended for human input with pause_all and retains a questionnaire_pending control marker
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZK>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZM>
              The foreground runtime is driven until settled
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZM>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZN>
              The runtime SHALL return at the human wait boundary without repeatedly resuming the marker
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZN>
            )>
            <Case #continue-others-marker-is-not-wake-work (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZP>
              A foreground fiber is suspended for human input with continue_others and its only pending wake item is the questionnaire_pending marker
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZP>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZQ>
              No other foreground fiber has runnable work
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZQ>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZR>
              The runtime SHALL return at the human wait boundary without repeatedly resuming the marker
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZR>
            )>
            <Case #background-does-not-delay-human-boundary (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZS>
              A foreground questionnaire is waiting for a human while unrelated background work remains registered
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZS>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZT>
              The interactive turn reaches the questionnaire wait
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZT>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZV>
              The foreground turn SHALL return without waiting for the unrelated background work
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZV>
            )>
            <Case #human-wait-is-explicit-result (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZW>
              The interactive coordinator observes a main or pause_all foreground human wait
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZW>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZX>
              The runtime may or may not be at a snapshot safepoint
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZX>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZY>
              The coordinator SHALL report blocked_on_human with the actual safepoint state and SHALL NOT report timeout_unsettled
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZY>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #questionnaire-answer-history (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZZ>
      TUI conversation history SHALL expose the user's questionnaire answer rather than the internal tool-result envelope.
      </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQSZZ>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #answer-projection { name = "Answer projection" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #raw-answer-visible (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT00>
              A questionnaire tool result contains canonical JSON with questionnaireId and rawText
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT00>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT01>
              The TUI projects conversation history
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT01>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT02>
              The visible text SHALL be rawText while the canonical JSON remains available to runtime/provider history
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT02>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #continuation-uses-typed-turn-projection (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT03>
      Questionnaire continuation SHALL 把 `resumeTurn` 的 `onControl`、`onChunk` 与 runtime history 全部交给通用 turn surface projector，并在 durable resync 时按稳定 identity reconciliation；continuation MUST NOT 把全部 chunk 硬编码为 assist。
      </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT03>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #typed-resume { name = "结构化恢复" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #resume-preserves-categories-and-tool-identity [
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT04>
              类别 SHALL 进入各自 surface，且同一 tool call 只 SHALL 有一个 ToolPart
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT04>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT05>
              恢复完成后的 conversation resync MUST NOT 复制已显示卡片
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT05>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT06>
              问卷恢复后的 turn 发出 turn、think、toolcall、result、assist 与 done 类别以及同一 toolCallId 的 history events
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT06>
              <When ?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT07>
              TUI 调用 resumeTurn
              </?01M05F1P3V7ND4WRCCABVTQT07>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
